xt\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Exemple </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"et\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"relie deux id\u00e9es\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Julien aime regarder et jouer au sport. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ou\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"permet le choix\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Tu peux prendre le bus ou conduire.  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mais\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"met deux id\u00e9es en opposition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Jean aime regarder les informations, mais il n'aime pas lire le journal. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le match", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une rencontre sportive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Allons au match de football ce soir.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le02ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " Voici des mots \u00e0 utiliser pour annuler des \u00e9v\u00e9nements pr\u00e9vus \u00e0 cause de la m\u00e9t\u00e9o. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le joueur, la joueuse", "type": "name"}, {"content": "personne qui joue \u00e0 un jeu ou \u00e0 un sport", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m./f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : C'est le meilleur joueur de l'\u00e9quipe. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le02ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "annuler", "typ